        "created_at": "2014-08-21T02:10:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was not planning on getting the minis at all for tactics.But, then I saw a proof copy of the pre-painted minis at Gencon…let me just say they were SO good I instantly changed my mind. Omnitron had a translucent blue back. That was a \"shut up and take my money\" moment haha</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have a feeling my Christmas and Birthday will involve painted Mini's. &nbsp;I personally can't paint at all. &nbsp;I used to do models, after 30 atrocious airplanes I conceeded that even using stencils I couldn't paint worth crap.</p>",
